# Copy to `.env.modelscope` (gitignored) before `bun run upload:modelscope`.
#
# CN (modelscope.cn / flowy2025/flowyaipc): MODELSCOPE_CN_TOKEN
# AI (modelscope.ai / flowy2025/flowy): MODELSCOPE_AI_TOKEN
# MODELSCOPE_TOKEN is accepted as a CN-only fallback.
#
# Generate tokens at:
#   https://www.modelscope.cn/my/myaccesstoken
#   https://www.modelscope.ai/my/myaccesstoken
#
# Keep them short-lived and revoke when no longer needed.
MODELSCOPE_CN_TOKEN=ms-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
MODELSCOPE_AI_TOKEN=ms-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
